    {
      "fileName": "devastating-shield-wallop.json",
      "id": "oNUIacH67QDxT5ki",
      "name": "Devastating Shield Wallop",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "oNUIacH67QDxT5ki",
        "folder": "8KwctFslFnxNmH4I",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Devastating Shield Wallop",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The impact of your shield sends foes tumbling to the ground. When you use Shield Wallop, after its other effects, the target attempts a @Check[fortitude|against:guardian|options:inflicts:off-guard,inflicts:prone,inflicts:stunned] saving throw against your class DC. If your shield is a tower shield, fortress shield, or another shield that grants a higher circumstance bonus to AC when you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Take Cover] behind it, the target takes a –2 circumstance penalty to this saving throw.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes no additional effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] to you until the end of the current turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is knocked prone and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 12
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Shield Wallop"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
